    "body": "## Summary\n- require a persisted authenticated user identity before saved-search list/create/update/delete operations touch persistence\n- add regression coverage for null and transient principals with zero repository/category access\n- document the saved-search identity invariant in the security baseline\n\n## Risk\nP1 privacy/authorization hardening. Prevents private saved-search state from reaching persistence with a missing or transient principal and avoids accidental fail-open/NPE behavior at the service boundary.\n\n## Validation\n- focused regression coverage added in `SavedSearchServiceTest`\n- full required GitHub Actions must be green on the exact PR head SHA before merge",
